                                        "entry_id": "c736ad2d-8f47-320f-9859-908579188ae3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A genre of adventure fiction where a hero is stranded alone on a desert island and has to survive with their own wits."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c087122-6d1e-46e0-be9d-d61066d34010",
                                                "sense_id": "73c5d17b-6c5d-33b5-b5e3-56e779b49698",
                                                "text": "Much, perhaps most, Minecraft fiction follows the robinsonade template, emphasizing the day-to-day life of a character, including nonhuman characters, striving to survive and thrive in a recognizably Minecraftian world by utilizing its resources."
                                            }
